# Build-context filter for projects/coven/deploy/Dockerfile (built from the
# repo root). The builder stage compiles the witchy binary from source, so the
# context needs the workspace sources (Cargo.toml/Cargo.lock, crates/, src/,
# std/, projects/, web/) - everything else is dead weight or local-only state.
.git
target
target-*
state
scratch
bugs
security-eval
coven-store
tests/browser/node_modules
tests/browser/test-results
.claude
*.log
